<title>USA: Westmark Group sells $2 mln in loans.</title>
<headline>Westmark Group sells $2 mln in loans.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westmark Group Holdings Inc said Tuesday it sold $2 million in non-conforming mortgage loans to Household Finance Corp.</p>
<p>It was Westmark's second loan sale to Household Finance in a month, the company said.</p>
</text>
